From 5df00b33c55f08851fd2f68d23f2fcd0cb784dce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Omkar Chandorkar <gotenksIN@aospa.co>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 08:43:30 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] packaging: Add native packages and Ubuntu CI

Provide Arch Linux and Ubuntu 26.04 packaging and rollback instructions.
Build and test Ubuntu packages in GitHub Actions, including required
SIGFM coverage, using the distribution-provided test dependencies.

Resolve release tags once, build their pinned commits, and collect
Ubuntu packages with SHA-256 checksums for publication without
requiring an Arch artifact.

Signed-off-by: Omkar Chandorkar <gotenksIN@aospa.co>
